Suggests: tmux, mosh
Description: terminal multiplexer for coding agents across your machines
 Gecko keeps shells, tmux sessions, SSH connections and coding agents
 running in a daemon and shows them in a web UI and a native window, on
 your desktop or your phone. Sessions survive closing the window, and you
 can see at a glance which agent is working and which one is waiting.
 .
 This package has the gecko command and daemon. The native window is the
 gecko-desktop package (Gecko's apt repository or the snap); without it,
 `gecko open` uses a browser app window.
